  Slug: disciple-of-the-gear
  DisplayName: Disciple of the Gear
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: "While many regard science and faith as incompatible, you believe
    scientific advancement is your deity's will. Perhaps you're a follower of Brigh,
    Casandalee, or some other god of technology, or perhaps you see the furnaces
    and sparks of modernity as the latest manifestation of Sarenrae's flame or Gozreh's
    lightning\u2014whatever the case, you're always willing to spread the word of
    your deity, and you've learned some basic tinkering to show how your deity's
    focus can increase the common standard of living. Choose two attribute boosts.
    One must be to Intelligence or Wisdom , and one is a free attribute boost. You're
    trained in the Crafting skill and the Lore skill for the deity you worship. You
    gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Quick Repair] skill feat."
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Guns & Gears
